/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Category:No_Material_items\" title=\"Category:No Material items\">None</a>:</b> There is no material defined for this item.  Quivers and cosmetic/store items have no listed material.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">N/A\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0000000005</span>5<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">cp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Copper Piece</a></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">0.50 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Spinner_of_Shadows\" title=\"The Spinner of Shadows\">The Spinner of Shadows</a></b>, The Silver Flame\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Alignment_damage_(weapon)#Holy\" title=\"Alignment damage (weapon)\">Holy</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Alignment_damage_(weapon)#Holy\" title=\"Alignment damage (weapon)\">Holy</a>:</b> A holy weapon is imbued with holy power. This power makes the weapon good-aligned. Evil characters wielding this weapon suffer a negative level. The weapon deals an extra 2 to 12 damage against all targets of <a href=\"/page/Evil\" title=\"Evil\">evil</a> alignment.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Sphere_of_Silver_Flame_Essence.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Sphere_of_Silver_Flame_Essence.png/420px-Sphere_of_Silver_Flame_Essence.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"339\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Sphere_of_Silver_Flame_Essence.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>This sphere contains a minuscule portion of a guardian spirit of the silver flame. Use it to smite your foes and claim your ground.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span>\n<ul><li>This projectile can also weaken <a href=\"/page/The_Spinner_of_Shadows_(monster)\" title=\"The Spinner of Shadows (monster)\">the Spinner</a>'s aura (see <a href=\"/page/The_Spinner_of_Shadows\" title=\"The Spinner of Shadows\">The Spinner of Shadows</a>).</li></ul></li>\n<li>This is an in-quest only item and is destroyed on exiting the adventure or on death.</li>\n<li>This item can only be received by talking to the Silver Flame spirit during the first phase of the quest.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817230401\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.069 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.109 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3771/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24362/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6241/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 15/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n133.98%  127.236     43 Template:IO\n100.00%   94.965      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   94.965      1 -total\n 97.06%   92.169      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 45.37%   43.085      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 44.53%   42.288      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 42.99%   40.825      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 41.98%   39.865      2 Template:InCategory\n 17.66%   16.775      1 Template:Mat\n 16.85%   16.000      3 Template:Popup\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:25636-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817230401 and revision id 668173. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
